    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例2. 求式$2+5^3$的值.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 212,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0221#8"
      ],
      "source_text": "例2. 求式$2+5^3$的值.",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "式$2+5^3$是由同样的两部分2和$5^3$所组成，因此：\n$2+5^3=2+125=127$（图156）.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 212,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0221#9"
      ],
      "source_text": "式$2+5^3$是由同样的两部分2和$5^3$所组成，因此：$2+5^3=2+125=127$（图156）.",
      "changes": [
